Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:37.87,Hdr,,0,0,0,,December 26, 1993 - Arima Kinen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,400 metres to go - out of the turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mejiro Palmer leads - Biwa Hayahide joins him and already takes over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,And out wide - oh! It's Tokai Teio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tokai Teio is closing fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:14.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Biwa Hayahide and Tokai Teio - a two-horse match race
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:16.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,The third horse is well back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:19.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Third, on the inside, is Machikane Tannhauser
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:21.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,And Nice Nature closing from the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up front, Tokai Teio has gone clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tokai Teio wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:32.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tokai Teio's miracle comeback - a dramatic win after a year away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:36.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's the pride of a Derby winner - an unbreakable run